  "description": "An alcoholic dragon, a chirpy girl. \n\nThe last living dragon, Axela, lives isolated in a fort with wine as his only comfort. Meanwhile, Corette, an orphaned but optimistic girl, moves in as his caretaker and ferociously tries to get him to warm up to her. Will the two overcome their differences and bickering? What will Axela do when Corette is suddenly taken hostage by the queen? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
